"The App Store copy is in /Applications. Quit Coulisse, move /Applications/Coulisse.app to the Trash, drag this copy into Applications, then open it from there." = "App Store kopija nalazi se u /Applications. Zatvori Coulisse, premjesti /Applications/Coulisse.app u smeće, povuci ovu kopiju u mapu Aplikacije, a zatim je otvori odande.";
"This account can't add apps to /Applications. Ask an administrator to drag Coulisse into /Applications, then open it from there." = "Ovaj račun ne može dodavati aplikacije u /Applications. Zamoli administratora da povuče Coulisse u /Applications, a zatim ga otvori odande.";
"Coulisse is running from outside Applications. The copy already in Applications goes to the Trash, then Coulisse relaunches from there." = "Coulisse radi izvan mape Aplikacije. Kopija koja je već u mapi Aplikacije premješta se u smeće, a zatim se Coulisse ponovno pokreće odande.";
